{"full":"hf:ciaochris/Education","spaceId":"ciaochris/Education","name":"Vers3Dynamics Tutor","source":"huggingface","description":"A tutor that gets quieter as you get stronger","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Python","topics":["gradio","region:us"],"technologies":["Python"],"likes":2,"created":"2024-08-30T22:49:45.000Z","updated":"2026-10-04T00:05:16.000Z","license":"apache-2.0","runtime":"RUNNING","appUrl":"https://ciaochris-education.hf.space/","demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/ciaochris/Education","availability":"available","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T23:59:46.156Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-19T23:59:46.156Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-19T23:59:46.156Z","color":"#3c3250","ink":"#e4d4ff","symbol":"📚","overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Vers3Dynamics Tutor helps you understand something well enough that you need the tutor less next time.","It is a learning studio, not an answer engine. Before it says anything, it decides what kind of help the moment calls for: an explanation, one diagnostic question, the smallest useful hint, one worked step, a counterexample, a prediction, a practice problem, or a problem in an unfamiliar context. Then it watches what you can do, and gives less help as you need less.","Don't do the thinking instead of the learner. Remove the obstacles that keep the learner from thinking. The measure of the tutor is what the learner can do when the tutor becomes quiet."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/ciaochris/Education/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"5dd22a3c87a1ab704ec6e7e57c5bd8a09c45f35a5658313a8ee95db43c8016bb","extractedAt":"2026-10-19T23:59:46.182Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T23:59:46.182Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Vers3Dynamics Tutor helps you understand something well enough that you need the tutor less next time.","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/ciaochris/Education/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"finger